                },
                {
                    "sense_id": "5629444c-9159-3789-b1d5-f383a0abdaeb",
                    "sense_definition": "Basic, fundamental, and not able to be divided further.",
                    "learner_level": "C1",
                    "frequency": "Low",
                    "semantic_group_id": "fundamental",
                    "name_type": "no",
                    "examples": [
                        {
                            "text": "Scientists are still searching for the <w>ultimate</w> constituents of matter.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
                                "ru": "Ученые все еще ищут <w>фундаментальные</w> составляющие материи.",
                                "tr": "Bilim insanları hala maddenin <w>temel</w> bileşenlerini arıyorlar.",
                                "zh": "科学家们仍在寻找物质的<w>基本</w>组成部分。"
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Philosophy often seeks to understand the <w>ultimate</w> nature of reality.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
